
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Vowora helps people create, acknowledge and manage meaningful commitments.">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#101b35">
  <title>Vowora – Every Promise Deserves a Record</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

  <header class="navbar">
    <a href="#" class="brand">
      <span class="brand-symbol">V</span>
      VOWORA
    </a>

    <nav>
      <a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
      <a href="#themes">Themes</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
    </nav>

    <button class="nav-button" onclick="showLogin()">
      Sign in
    </button>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="eyebrow">A NEW WAY TO HONOUR COMMITMENTS</span>

        <h1>Every Promise<br>
          <span>Deserves a Record.</span>
        </h1>

        <p>
          Create meaningful commitments, share them with someone
          important, and keep track of every promise together.
        </p>

        <button class="primary-button" onclick="showCreate()">
          Create Your Promise <span>→</span>
        </button>

        <p class="small-note">
          Simple. Personal. Mutual.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-card">
        <div class="card-top">
          <span>✦ MUTUAL COMMITMENT</span>
          <span class="status">NEW</span>
        </div>

        <div class="card-icon">∞</div>

        <h2>A promise worth keeping.</h2>
        <p>Two people. One commitment. A record that matters.</p>

        <div class="card-divider"></div>

        <div class="card-footer">
          <span>YOUR PROMISE</span>
          <span>YOUR STORY</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="features" id="how-it-works">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">HOW VOWORA WORKS</span>
        <h2>Make commitments meaningful.</h2>
        <p>A simple process built around mutual acknowledgement.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">✍</div>
          <h3>01. Create</h3>
          <p>Write your promise, choose a theme and set the terms.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">↗</div>
          <h3>02. Share</h3>
          <p>Invite the other person through a private invitation link.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">✓</div>
          <h3>03. Acknowledge</h3>
          <p>Both people review and acknowledge the agreed commitment.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">∞</div>
          <h3>04. Preserve</h3>
          <p>Keep a record of milestones, changes and outcomes.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="themes" id="themes">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">ONE PLATFORM. MANY MEANINGS.</span>
        <h2>Choose your promise theme.</h2>
        <p>Different relationships. One shared commitment experience.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="theme-grid">
        <button class="theme-card business" onclick="selectTheme('Business')">
          <span>◈</span><strong>Business</strong>
          <small>Professional commitments</small>
        </button>

        <button class="theme-card love" onclick="selectTheme('Love')">
          <span>♡</span><strong>Love</strong>
          <small>Promises from the heart</small>
        </button>

        <button class="theme-card friends" onclick="selectTheme('Friends')">
          <span>✦</span><strong>Friends</strong>
          <small>Friendship commitments</small>
        </button>

        <button class="theme-card family" onclick="selectTheme('Family')">
          <span>⌂</span><strong>Family</strong>
          <small>Promises that bring us closer</small>
        </button>

        <button class="theme-card personal" onclick="selectTheme('Personal')">
          <span>◎</span><strong>Personal</strong>
          <small>Commitments to yourself</small>
        </button>

        <button class="theme-card custom" onclick="selectTheme('Custom')">
          <span>✧</span><strong>Custom</strong>
          <small>Create your own experience</small>
        </button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about" id="about">
      <span class="eyebrow">THE VOWORA IDEA</span>
      <h2>More than words.<br> A commitment you can revisit.</h2>
      <p>
        Vowora is designed to help people document mutual commitments,
        acknowledge agreed terms and keep track of changes and outcomes.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="cta">
      <h2>Ready to make a promise?</h2>
      <p>Start creating a meaningful commitment today.</p>
      <button class="primary-button" onclick="showCreate()">
        Get Started →
      </button>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <a href="#" class="brand">VOWORA</a>
    <p>Every Promise Deserves a Record.</p>
    <small>
      Vowora provides digital commitment records. It does not
      guarantee legal enforceability or independently verify identities.
    </small>
    <p>© 2026 Vowora. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

  <div id="message-modal" class="modal" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <button class="close-button" onclick="closeModal()">×</button>
      <h2 id="modal-title">Welcome to Vowora</h2>
      <p id="modal-message"></p>
      <button class="primary-button" onclick="closeModal()">Continue</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
